note Args: x (R0:1), W_pool[256,N,K] (R2:3), S_pool[256,N/128,K/128] (R4:5),
note       ids[8] (R6:7), lut[256] (R8:9), C[8,N] (R10:11), K (48), N (52), x_stride (56).
